{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_slchan_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_slchan_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "崖上之心",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_slchan_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "01cb4c9f73cfdd8d5a3c2eb785e6b3ff7d9bbff6aa95ac85d68c369be330f7e9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "崖心个人剧情1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊的岩縫，距離應該足夠近......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯哥，老哥還要多久才能回來啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照老爺出行前的預估，大概還有個三四天吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸——還有好久——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？怎麼這麼巧，老哥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，難道是姐姐？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖女大人去蔓珠院才幾個月，現在事務繁多，不會是她的。您少安毋躁，我去開門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——塔耶爾婆婆，您怎麼來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣就更近了一步！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山洞的位置並不高，應該沒多少距離了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "淚石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是種礦石吧，淡藍色的，只在聖山中段的一個山洞中出產，傳說是耶拉岡德的眼淚凝結成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還差一步！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔耶爾公公病情加重，本來還能用大半年的淚石，一秋天就用光了，而且整個山區都借不到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，按照傳說，淚石一次只能開採一個手掌，也就是耶拉岡德一滴眼淚的大小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如一次從洞中帶出去的淚石太多，一隻手無法握住，淚石就會失效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實塔耶爾公公之前用的淚石也是您採的，不過那是兩年前的事，您可能記不得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣——對啊，我想起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯哥，麻煩你駕車帶著塔耶爾婆婆再跑一跑，看看還有沒有人有淚石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那小姐您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在家裡找找。我記得自己以前採過一點淚石當擺件，只是不知道放到哪兒去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您記清楚了？真的採過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "採、採過的。我一找到就去給塔耶爾公公磨碎，然後為他煎藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯哥也是，如果借到了淚石，不用回來告訴我，直接去塔耶爾家就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，您可千萬要謹慎行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就......找找東西而已，有什麼可謹慎的。魏斯哥，快去吧，這可是人命關天的大事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去備車了。塔耶爾婆婆，您跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亞轉過頭，望瞭望鉛灰色的天空。\n此刻雲層還不算太厚，窗外一絲風也沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯哥的直覺還是那麼敏銳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是塔耶爾公公的情況確實緊急，他肯定不會離開，一定會在家裡寸步不離地盯著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他也是擔心過頭啦。看樣子大雪要到晚上才下，那個山洞又沒多高，從峭壁一側爬起來還是很快的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後就是進山洞開採淚石了，應該用不了多久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亞閉上雙眼，默默朝巍峨的聖山行了一禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開採完成！正好我一個手掌的大小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然剛才是糊弄魏斯哥的，不過淚石也真漂亮。下次要不要真的採一點當擺件呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說來，我兩年前開採的痕跡還留在石壁上，一點也沒多，一點也沒少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亞站在山洞口，朝山下望去。塔耶爾家的炊煙依稀可見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等著我，塔耶爾公公，我這就把淚石給你送去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好冷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "起風了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g13_mountpath_s"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，風雪比預料中來得早了這麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能再從峭壁一側下山了。得回到山洞中，等風雪過去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，風雪不知什麼時候才停，塔耶爾公公還等著淚石呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能從另一側找路下山了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，呼......這邊的路雖然可以步行，可是，方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這棵樹......不對，這是，我回到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑且用登山繩做了路標。這樣一來，至少不會原地打轉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這條路......和我家是反方向啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，這場雪來得真不是時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺已經走了好遠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山洞的位置在山區和湖區交界的山區一側，可我朝湖區方向走了這麼遠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這已經算是擅闖佩爾羅契家領地了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不經通報，無故擅闖他人領地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雖然哥哥從來不主動跟她談起另外兩家的事，但恩希亞並不傻。\n她知道，自從哥哥回到謝拉格，佩爾羅契家與希瓦艾什家就一直在交惡。\n哥哥這次離家前也特地囑咐她，如果沒必要，不要和佩爾羅契家打交道。\n謝拉格的局勢實在太過微妙，就算是無心的輕聲細語，也可能引發一場恐怖的雪崩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不，趕在佩爾羅契家還沒發現之前回頭，等雪停了再從峭壁下山......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不行。這雪完全沒有要停的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是人命關天的大事，時間一點也不能耽擱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......幸虧雪下得這麼大，居然一點都沒摔傷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，能看到山下的聚落了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有湖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在山背裡轉了這麼久，這條路怎麼還沒走完......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛能看見的湖也看不見了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然能判斷出是在下山，可這山路也太長了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如同神跡一般，在恩希亞的視野裡，風雪深處，出現了一個人的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽得到嗎？我在這兒！我在這兒！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "來人顯然已經捕捉到了恩希亞的位置，徑直朝著恩希亞的方向走了過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝耶拉岡德！你是山上的獵戶嗎？這裡離山腳還有多遠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沿著這條路走下去，大概一個半小時就能下山了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個半小時？還有這麼遠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼下山的捷徑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有倒是有，不過風雪這麼大，走不通的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有登山工具！你看這個背包，冰鎬、登山繩、岩釘......我都有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......那倒確實可以試一試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你往回折一點，到剛剛那個能看到湖的地方，那裡有一條有點陡的小路，被雪蓋住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你！你叫什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亞的話還沒說完，就像耶拉岡德有意遮蔽引路人的身形一樣，她的視野裡只剩漫天的風雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不見了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先不管了，我得去那邊試試！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣至少搶出了一個多小時的時間！我得去找個地方，至少雇一匹馱獸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡山人",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別動！誰在那裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，我沒有惡意！我是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你不是希瓦艾什家的二小姐嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請聽我解釋，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，我只是個巡山的。有什麼話，你去跟家主說吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g5_guestroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "僕人剛剛奉上的熱茶和糖果還在桌上散發著香氣，但會客室內的二人既未落座，也未用滴水沾唇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說吧，怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起！我不是有意要闖入您的領地的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每個闖入者被抓了都喜歡說這種話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，你在自家宅子裡散步賞雪，一不小心就走到湖區來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我是去山洞裡採淚石的，剛出了山洞，雪就下了起來。我沒法從自家一側的峭壁返回，這才走了反方向的路，到了湖區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你看不見滿天的陰雲，非要在風雪將至的時候去採淚石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，阿克托斯先生，您聽我說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希瓦艾什家的二小姐擅闖我佩爾羅契家領地，這件事可大可小，我也不想鬧得太難看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你的好哥哥回來，讓他自己來跟我解釋吧。如果他能解釋得通，我就放你回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等到老哥回來？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（塔耶爾公公的病已經沒時間耽擱了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（現在要把藥送去，只能——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可這樣一來，不知道阿克托斯先生又要提什麼要求，會不會讓老哥為難......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可惡，這事和兩家的矛盾明明一點關係都沒有，只因為我是希瓦艾什，就不得不......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（老哥，對不起了！如果惹了什麼麻煩，我一定會負責到底！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你的表情，似乎還有什麼話要說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擅闖湖區一事，我感到非常抱歉，也接受您對此事的處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我採淚石是為了救人性命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用人命當藉口可一點都不好笑，恩希亞·希瓦艾什。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是真的！住在山區的塔耶爾公公病重，需要淚石救命，我這才冒險上山的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您對我的處罰我都接受，我只請求您派一輛快車，趕快把我背包裡的淚石送到山區的塔耶爾家，求您了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你說你是採淚石去了，把採來的淚石給我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g5_guestroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......確實是淚石沒錯。不過，是不是有點太大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在出山洞時特地用手試過了，抓得住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虧你們希瓦艾什家的人還能記住幾句耶拉岡德的教誨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "送到山區的塔耶爾家，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我姑且幫你一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我準備最快的馱獸！我要和恩希亞·希瓦艾什小姐去一趟山區！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（謝天謝地......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（——等等，和我去？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿克托斯先生，您的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果情況屬實，那麼擅闖領地一事，就是你的無心之失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩爾羅契還不至於為了這種事斤斤計較。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為您會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會怎樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼，沒什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g11_snowylane"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝天謝地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向您致以最誠摯的感謝，阿克托斯先生！如果再晚一點，就真的趕不上了。真的，太謝謝您了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "淚石是你採的，人是你救的，沒什麼好謝我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，還是謝謝您！您要不要來我家烤烤火？角峰叔應該也快回來了，沒準我可以讓他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿克托斯沒有說話，只是站在原地，沉默地看著興奮的恩希亞，如同一塊堅硬的山岩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，是我欠考慮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必介意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿克托斯先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得老哥沒回來時，雖然我和姐姐跟您打交道並不多，但您並不像現在這樣，先入為主地和我保持著距離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你覺得有誰應該為此負責，那當然是你的好哥哥。我可以相信你沒有惡意，但我可不敢說，你的好哥哥沒有把你也算計進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "論勾心鬥角，我可從來不敢說自己能勝過他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老哥......在別人眼裡，他真的這麼令人討厭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至可以容忍他的那些陰謀詭計，但他對傳統的踐踏，我決不能視而不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但外來的事物也不全是壞的呀！就說塔耶爾公公的病，也許外界有更好的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亞把話說到一半，看到阿克托斯臉上的神情，這才意識到，眼前的佩爾羅契家家主並未因一次舉手之勞，就和自己拉近了多少距離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看得出，你和你哥哥不是一類人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你們都是如假包換的希瓦艾什。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是這麼說，您也是如假包換的佩爾羅契了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但您還是幫了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是覺得我應該對塔耶爾見死不救，還是覺得我應該繼續把你扣著，不讓你走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......有點不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你可以接著想，日子還長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿著你自己的背包。你出門時高興得過了頭，連包都忘了拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g11_snowylane"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是——恩希亞小姐，是您嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯哥？是我！我在這兒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩希亞小姐，可急死我了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您可千萬不要再這麼以身犯險了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這不是好好的嘛，淚石也及時送到了。雖然出了點小意外，不過也沒誤事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......您和老爺一樣倔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，您可能還不知道，老爺這次出國，有一部分原因，就是要開發淚石這種資源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "資源？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺之前請維多利亞的科學家研究過，淚石之所以能治病，是因為其中含有一種特殊物質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而這種物質並不會因為一次帶出山洞的量的多少而發生藥效上的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果淚石的開採和提煉能形成產業，不僅可以改善謝拉格的經濟，還能讓謝拉格的藥物造福更多國家的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐也就不用這麼辛苦又危險地去採淚石啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恩希亞聽著魏斯的話，不禁想起山洞中的光景。\n晶瑩的淚石鑲嵌在岩壁上，讓人恍惚覺得，那真的是耶拉岡德的淚滴。\n為了塔耶爾公公的病，她採了兩次淚石，而那兩次開採的痕跡，也清晰地留在了洞裡。\n和年代已經無法考證的數十處痕跡混雜在一起。\n恩希亞突然不安起來，好像哥哥的開採計畫與洞中美麗的景象存在著某種內在的衝突。\n為了驅散這種不安，她主動轉移了話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，我們今晚吃什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽角峰大哥說，今天的主菜是燴獸肉，相當令人期待啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才還不覺得，你這麼一說，我的肚子已經咕咕叫起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您有食欲就再好不過。那，登山包照例是您自己整理，我去廚房幫廚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯哥，還有什麼事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是今天下午的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想著要好好謝謝你，結果你連名字也不告訴我，就走得無影無蹤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這不是來了嘛。喏，這是給你的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是——姐姐的信？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自我介紹一下，我是聖女大人的侍女長。叫我雅兒就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐的侍女長？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道姐姐知道我今天去爬山了，所以才派雅兒姐來給我指路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不是。下午的時候，我只是下山買東西，和你偶遇了而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你可千萬別告訴姐姐我在雪天爬山的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看姐姐在蔓珠院過得怎麼樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，還好還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雅兒姐，謝謝你給我送信！我去跟角峰叔說一聲，晚飯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓——我可是偷溜進來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偷溜？為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想，假如我大大方方地敲門進來，說自己是聖女大人的侍女長，魏斯會怎麼辦？他一定會報告給你哥哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以你哥哥的思路，蔓珠院的人趁他不在的時候跑來給你送信，他十有八九要多心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是等你哥哥回來了，再正式跟你們家的諸位作自我介紹吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雅兒姐，雖然信裡沒說，可姐姐一定還在生老哥的氣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實不相瞞，你猜得沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道姐姐最後會和阿克托斯先生站在一邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和聖女大人相處的時間比我長得多，她作為希瓦艾什家長女的一面，你理當比我熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖女大人對你哥哥可能生了很大的氣，但你畢竟是兩個人共同的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然也不會有這封信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但她現在已經是蔓珠院的聖女大人了。就算她想回護我，在形勢面前，恐怕也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像今天，和阿克托斯先生打了交道之後，我發現他也不是個壞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管是什麼人，只要一涉及爭權奪利的事，大家就都——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來你擔心這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，總之先打起精神，高興一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從一開始就這麼悲觀，這可不像聖女大人口中活潑又樂觀的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖女大人確實不是會被感情推著走的人。謝拉格聖女肩上的責任有多重，她比任何人都要清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，她到底會怎麼做，不光取決於你哥哥，也取決於你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是你哥哥的附屬品，你有自己的路要走。而你選擇的道路，也一定會對你的哥哥姐姐產生影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能確定，但你的道路，或許會成為他們兩人之間的橋樑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像......有點明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就先回去了。要躲過你們家的魏斯也挺麻煩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼著急？我還沒好好謝謝你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以後我們見面的次數還多著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
